<header class="page-header">
  <div>
<p class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE / Dashboard</p>
<h1>운영 개요<span class="heading-dot">
</span>
</h1>
<p class="page-description">피드에서 Discord까지, 알림의 흐름을 한눈에 확인하세요.</p>
</div>
  <div class="actions">
<button class="secondary" hx-get="/" hx-target="[data-page='dashboard']" hx-select="[data-page='dashboard']" hx-swap="outerHTML">{{> icon name="refresh"}}새로고침</button>
</div>
</header>
<section data-page="dashboard" hx-get="/" hx-trigger="every 30s" hx-select="[data-page='dashboard']" hx-swap="outerHTML">
  <dl class="metric-grid" id="dashboard-counts">
    <div class="metric">
<dt>등록된 소스<span class="metric-icon">{{> icon name="rss"}}</span>
</dt>
<dd>{{counts.sources}}<span>개</span>
</dd>
<p>등록된 RSS·Atom 피드</p>
</div>
    <div class="metric">
<dt>수집 중<span class="metric-icon green">{{> icon name="activity"}}</span>
</dt>
<dd>{{counts.enabled}}<span>개</span>
</dd>
<p>
<span class="tiny-dot green">
</span>활성화된 수집 소스</p>
</div>
    <div class="metric">
<dt>수집 오류<span class="metric-icon amber">{{> icon name="alert"}}</span>
</dt>
<dd>{{counts.errors}}<span>개</span>
</dd>
<p>{{#if counts.errors}}최근 수집 결과를 확인하세요{{else}}최근 수집 오류가 없습니다{{/if}}</p>
</div>
    <div class="metric">
<dt>연결된 그룹<span class="metric-icon blue">{{> icon name="layers"}}</span>
</dt>
<dd>{{counts.connectedGroups}}<span>개</span>
</dd>
<p>Discord 웹훅이 설정된 그룹</p>
</div>
  </dl>
    <div class="dashboard-primary">
      <section class="panel table-panel">
<div class="panel-header">
<div>
<h2>수집 소스 현황 <span class="count-pill">{{counts.sources}}</span>
</h2>
<p>각 피드의 활성 상태와 마지막 수집 결과입니다.</p>
</div>
<a class="text-link" href="/sources">전체 보기 {{> icon name="arrow"}}</a>
</div>
        <div class="table-scroll">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>소스</th>
<th>프로필</th>
<th>상태</th>
<th>마지막 수집</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody id="dashboard-sources">
        {{#each sources}}<tr>
<td>
<a class="source-identity" href="/sources/{{id}}">
<span class="source-avatar">{{> icon name="rss"}}</span>
<span>
<strong>{{name}}</strong>
<small class="feed-url">{{feedUrl}}</small>
</span>
</a>
</td>
<td>
<code>{{profile}}</code>
</td>
<td>
<span class="badge {{#if enabled}}ok{{else}}muted{{/if}}">{{#if enabled}}수집 중{{else}}중지됨{{/if}}</span>
</td>
<td>
<span class="outcome {{#if hasError}}error{{/if}}">{{outcomeLabel}}</span>
</td>
</tr>
        {{else}}<tr>
<td colspan="4">
<div class="empty-state">
<span class="empty-icon">{{> icon name="rss"}}</span>
<h3>첫 번째 피드를 연결해 보세요</h3>
<p>수집 소스에서 RSS 또는 Atom 피드를 등록하면<br>이곳에서 수집 상태를 확인할 수 있습니다.</p>
</div>
</td>
</tr>{{/each}}
        </tbody>
</table>
</div>
      </section>
      <section class="panel activity-panel">
<div class="panel-header">
<div>
<h2>최근 활동</h2>
<p>수집·발송·번역의 최신 기록입니다.</p>
</div>
<a class="text-link" href="/logs">로그 보기 {{> icon name="arrow"}}</a>
</div>
<div class="activity-list">
        {{#each recentEvents}}<div class="activity-row">
<span class="activity-symbol {{#if failed}}amber{{/if}}">{{> icon name=icon}}</span>
<div class="activity-copy">
<strong>{{label}}</strong>
<p>{{#if sourceName}}{{sourceName}}{{else}}{{detail}}{{/if}}</p>
</div>
<time datetime="{{createdAt}}">{{timeLabel}}</time>
</div>
        {{else}}<div class="empty-inline">{{> icon name="clock"}}아직 활동이 없습니다. 수집이 시작되면 이곳에 표시됩니다.</div>{{/each}}
      </div>
</section>
    </div>
    <div class="dashboard-footnote">{{> icon name="refresh"}}30초마다 자동으로 갱신됩니다.</div>
</section>
